infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title npm ci vs npm install
  desc Which install command belongs in CI with a committed lockfile
  compares
    - label npm ci
      children
        - label Lockfile-only
          desc Installs strictly from package-lock.json
        - label Fails on drift
          desc Errors if package.json and the lock disagree
        - label Verified clean tree
          desc Wipes node_modules, checks every sha512 hash
        - label Use in CI
          desc Deterministic, reproducible, tamper-evident
    - label npm install
      children
        - label Resolves ranges
          desc May pick newer versions inside ^ or ~
        - label Mutates the lock
          desc Rewrites package-lock.json in place
        - label Can pull a bad patch
          desc A new in-range malicious release slips in
        - label Local only
          desc Use when changing deps; review the lock diff
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
